                                                "sense_id": "4ed47937-9930-3394-92c6-fc7534a7ba35",
                                                "text": "But you ſay they do not accept of them, but delight rather to lean to their old Cuſtoms and Brehon Laws, though they be more unjuſt and alſo more inconvenient for the common People, as by your late Relation of them I have gathered."
                                            }
