                                                "sense_id": "0adda192-deca-3d94-9f59-fb414a0725be",
                                                "text": "Kitting for in-plant handling is unlean. Kitting for transport, on the other hand, is lean; for example, shipping complete sets of parts to make a TV or motorcycle or motor home is lean."
                                            }
